flowchart TD
    %% Sources: prope_source_of_truth.md 4.2, 10.4, S6, MVP, Release 2; business-analysis.md FR-05/FR-06.

    start([Start: Reviewer receives a revision])
    entry["[TBD Screen] Review Entry or Notification"]
    permission{Permission to review?\nRules: Unverified / TBD}
    denied[Access Unavailable]
    detail[Review Detail]
    evidence[Diff, Test Evidence, Cost, Risk, and Usage]
    checklist[Review Checklist and Comments]
    sufficient{Evidence sufficient?}
    decision{Approve or request changes?}
    changes[Changes Requested and Decision Recorded]
    approved[Approved Trusted Revision and Decision Recorded]
    owner_return[Return to Owner]
    end_changes([End: revision returned for changes])
    end_approved([End: trusted revision Approved])
    end_denied([End: review not permitted])

    start --> entry
    entry --> permission
    permission -->|No| denied
    denied --> end_denied
    permission -->|Yes| detail
    detail -->|Inspect revision| evidence
    evidence -->|Review checklist and comment| checklist
    checklist --> sufficient
    sufficient -->|No| changes
    sufficient -->|Yes| decision
    decision -->|Request changes| changes
    decision -->|Approve revision| approved
    changes -->|Return to owner| owner_return
    owner_return --> end_changes
    approved --> end_approved
